DSH Session Pet
Maintained fork: https://github.com/ltmroberthk915/dsh-pet

Based on dsh-pet by the upstream contributors:
https://github.com/zhu1090093659/dsh-pet
Original package: @linxin666/dsh-pet
Licensed under Apache-2.0; the original LICENSE and asset notices are retained.

Fork changes include session-specific companions, optional reviewed desktop bridge,
model palettes, configurable tok/s playback, shared affinity, reduced idle work,
placement avoidance, and completion review lifecycle.

Version 1.1.0 adds Miku artwork/gameplay from upstream v0.4.4, attributed to
stushansusu (涂山苏苏), plus AI-assisted session poses and an original business
blue whale. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for artwork and character notices.
